  "answer_text": "It appears that **The Flash (CW series) has ended**. Here's a summary of what happened:\n\n- During the course of the series, 184 episodes of *The Flash* aired over **nine seasons**, between **October 7, 2014, and May 24, 2023**.\n\n- *The Flash* Season 9 was the end of the road for the series, and it also ended the Arrowverse as a whole, as The CW had canceled the last few series that made up the shared DC TV universe before Season 9 premiered.\n\n- There are currently **no TV airings of *The Flash* in the next 14 days**. You can add the show to your Watchlist on TV Guide to find out if it ever comes back.\n\nSo unfortunately, there are **no new episodes** of *The Flash* (CW) planned at this time. If you're interested in a new Flash project, you might want to keep an eye out for any future DC Universe announcements, as James Gunn's DCU reboot may eventually feature a new version of the character.",
